WEBVTT

00:29.237 --> 00:30.739
What is this place?

00:30.822 --> 00:34.159
It seems this castle fell into disrepair
during the revolution,

00:34.242 --> 00:39.873
abandoned and forgotten
because it's in a remote location.

00:39.956 --> 00:45.420
I don't like when those demons
act like lords.

00:47.005 --> 00:51.509
Are you sure that the villagers
were taken there?

00:51.593 --> 00:52.677
Yes.

00:52.761 --> 00:56.306
We even tracked them
into the keep last night,

00:56.389 --> 00:58.183
but we found nothing.

00:58.266 --> 01:01.311
They can't just disappear, you idiot.

01:01.394 --> 01:03.271
You're so easily fooled.

01:03.354 --> 01:04.856
My apologies.

01:04.939 --> 01:09.819
And today, another woman disappeared.

01:09.903 --> 01:13.990
While we were on the lookout,
they took them right under our noses.

01:14.074 --> 01:16.868
I don't expect anything from you guys.

01:18.161 --> 01:22.749
Apparently, we're not too late.

01:22.832 --> 01:24.209
That bastard!

01:43.061 --> 01:46.147
I should have killed them last night.

02:44.581 --> 02:45.915
Got you!

02:52.630 --> 02:54.757
You guys, get back.

02:54.841 --> 02:57.844
The Wind Hashira and I
will take it from here.

02:57.927 --> 02:58.970
But…

02:59.053 --> 03:02.891
You guys are in our way.
Just get the hell out of here.

03:06.185 --> 03:10.231
Shinazugawa,
something strange is going on here.

03:10.315 --> 03:13.318
Yeah, I don't like it.

03:13.401 --> 03:16.654
I've never seen so many demons
swarming in one place.

03:18.031 --> 03:19.073
Help me!

03:24.746 --> 03:27.665
Wind Breathing, Second Form:

03:33.046 --> 03:35.381
Claws-Purifying Wind!

03:40.762 --> 03:43.723
Serpent Breathing, Fifth Form:

03:52.065 --> 03:54.025
Slithering Serpent.

03:55.026 --> 03:56.486
That was close.

03:56.569 --> 03:58.238
I didn't ask for your help!

04:00.281 --> 04:04.244
This strength…
They're not ordinary demon hunters.

04:04.327 --> 04:05.411
They're Hashiras!

04:05.495 --> 04:06.996
Help me!

04:07.080 --> 04:08.206
Hey, demon!

04:08.289 --> 04:11.292
Leave that woman and your head here!

04:12.460 --> 04:13.711
Out of my way!

04:14.712 --> 04:17.340
They just keep appearing
one after another.

04:17.423 --> 04:19.842
Are you demons or cockroaches?

04:21.177 --> 04:22.303
There!

04:34.315 --> 04:36.192
There are still more?

04:39.279 --> 04:42.407
Where the hell
are those demons coming from?

04:42.490 --> 04:45.868
Save the woman, Shinazugawa.

04:45.952 --> 04:47.787
I got your six.

04:49.831 --> 04:52.208
Well, I'm getting bored too.

04:52.292 --> 04:54.335
I'll let you take care of them.

04:57.714 --> 05:00.758
Serpent Breathing, Third Form:

05:07.432 --> 05:09.100
Coil Choke.

05:16.899 --> 05:20.695
Listen, you can't win
even if you gather these small fries.

05:20.778 --> 05:23.197
Just give up and die.

05:35.418 --> 05:37.462
Wind Breathing,

05:37.545 --> 05:39.047
Fourth Form:

05:42.550 --> 05:44.469
Rising Dust Storm.

05:46.304 --> 05:47.764
Good grief.

05:47.847 --> 05:50.308
If you want her so badly…

05:50.391 --> 05:52.268
No! What are you going to do?

05:52.351 --> 05:53.561
Catch her!

06:09.535 --> 06:10.995
What?

06:31.724 --> 06:34.352
Stay there, shithead!

06:47.532 --> 06:49.117
What the heck is going on?

06:50.201 --> 06:53.454
Hey, Shinazugawa. What was that?

06:54.914 --> 06:57.125
Where have the demons gone?

06:59.544 --> 07:01.087
How the hell do I know?

07:19.647 --> 07:22.733
You sure you want to get off
at the end of this road?

07:42.587 --> 07:45.047
KOCHO

07:52.555 --> 07:53.764
Miss Kanao!

07:53.848 --> 07:56.434
Good work on completing your mission!

07:56.517 --> 07:58.269
Good work!

08:17.038 --> 08:19.707
Master, I have just returned.

08:21.667 --> 08:26.506
That matter of the Swordsmith Village
was just like I told you the other day.

08:26.589 --> 08:30.676
Tokito, Kanroji,

08:30.760 --> 08:35.640
Kamado and the others
have defeated two Upper Ranks.

08:36.557 --> 08:41.103
Moreover, Nezuko has overcome the sun.

08:41.187 --> 08:45.525
Hence, there will be
major developments to come.

08:46.484 --> 08:47.652
Yes.

08:48.361 --> 08:54.033
Probably, Muzan Kibutsuji will use
his demons to take Nezuko away.

08:56.118 --> 09:00.331
In order to own a demon
that overcomes the sun.

09:06.128 --> 09:12.843
I will attend an urgent Hashira meeting
at the Ubuyashiki residence.

09:13.761 --> 09:19.016
In the meantime,
can I ask you to protect Nezuko?

09:23.104 --> 09:25.064
It's a request.

09:27.108 --> 09:33.990
DEMON SLAYER: KIMETSU NO YAIBA
HASHIRA TRAINING ARC

09:37.702 --> 09:40.371
I see. They're already moving their base.

09:41.372 --> 09:43.207
Are the villagers all right?

09:43.916 --> 09:46.085
I don't know that much about the details.

09:46.168 --> 09:48.754
The demons might attack at night,

09:48.838 --> 09:51.674
so they're desperately
rebuilding and relocating.

09:51.757 --> 09:52.925
Is that so?

09:53.009 --> 09:57.555
It's miraculous how that was all it took
even though two Upper Ranks attacked.

09:58.848 --> 10:01.684
The enemies were really strong.

10:08.691 --> 10:12.695
The Corps created several "empty villages"
for such occasions.

10:12.778 --> 10:15.448
So we're able to move quickly
if something happens.

10:15.531 --> 10:16.741
I see.

10:17.366 --> 10:21.621
Well, that's because the Master and
his family's predictions are incredible.

10:21.704 --> 10:24.457
Anyway, you've been unconscious
for a week.

10:24.540 --> 10:26.167
Is it okay to eat that much?

10:26.250 --> 10:29.545
Yes! Kanroji said she also eats a lot.

10:30.546 --> 10:33.966
Nah, she seems a bit beyond reason.

10:35.426 --> 10:37.094
Delicious!

10:37.178 --> 10:38.721
Is it true that Love and Mist

10:38.804 --> 10:42.058
slept for two days and were almost
fully recovered by the third day?

10:42.141 --> 10:44.018
It's true! I respect them!

10:44.101 --> 10:47.730
You're getting closer to them, you know?
Bit by bit.

10:48.522 --> 10:51.692
Well, it's fine if you get better soon.

10:51.776 --> 10:52.902
Yes?

10:52.985 --> 10:54.904
I'm glad everyone is alive.

10:54.987 --> 10:56.030
Yes!

10:56.113 --> 10:58.783
Oh, this is what I wanted to ask the most.

10:58.866 --> 11:01.535
I heard your sister
has become something incredible.

11:01.619 --> 11:03.079
Is she all right?

11:03.162 --> 11:04.538
Yes, she is.

11:05.414 --> 11:08.918
She's starting to toddle under the sun.

11:10.628 --> 11:11.754
Isn't that bad?

11:12.338 --> 11:14.256
Seriously, isn't that dangerous?

11:14.965 --> 11:18.302
She's being examined,
but we still don't know anything.

11:19.136 --> 11:23.182
We don't know if she's turning back
into a human or evolving as a demon.

11:24.016 --> 11:26.102
Is Lady Kocho looking into it?

11:26.185 --> 11:27.895
Not her, Lady Tamayo.

11:27.978 --> 11:29.647
Who's Lady Tamayo?

11:32.149 --> 11:34.610
Hey, see? You ate too much!

11:34.693 --> 11:37.154
You should know
that you're still recovering.

11:38.030 --> 11:39.573
That was close.

11:41.200 --> 11:45.538
Your sister has become like that
and things are going to start happening.

11:45.621 --> 11:48.999
Every Corps member has been given
an order to be on alert.

11:49.083 --> 11:52.128
And we're told the Hashiras are gathering.

11:52.211 --> 11:54.672
What happens from now on, really?

12:10.938 --> 12:13.107
We're the last ones, huh?

12:13.190 --> 12:16.152
Sorry for keeping you waiting.

12:17.319 --> 12:20.239
No problem. Well done on your mission.

12:20.322 --> 12:21.740
STONE HASHIRA
GYOMEI HIMEJIMA

12:21.824 --> 12:23.284
It's nothing.

12:24.869 --> 12:28.080
I heard Kanroji and Tokito
had a fight against the Upper Ranks.

12:28.164 --> 12:29.623
WIND HASHIRA
SANEMI SHINAZUGAWA

12:29.707 --> 12:31.250
Yup. They were strong.

12:31.333 --> 12:32.626
LOVE HASHIRA
MITSURI KANROJI

12:32.710 --> 12:36.297
I felt like I couldn't do it anymore,
but we all pulled together.

12:36.380 --> 12:37.756
Right, Muichiro?

12:38.799 --> 12:39.884
Yeah.

12:39.967 --> 12:41.469
MIST HASHIRA
MUICHIRO TOKITO

12:42.887 --> 12:44.847
That makes me jealous.

12:44.930 --> 12:48.142
Why haven't I ever encountered
any Upper Rank?

12:49.268 --> 12:52.813
It's like almost everyone
is running into them.

12:52.897 --> 12:54.190
SERPENT HASHIRA
OBANAI IGURO

12:54.273 --> 12:58.486
Kanroji and Tokito,
how were you afterwards?

12:58.569 --> 13:02.531
Oh! Thanks for asking.
I'm much better now.

13:02.615 --> 13:05.284
Oh, my! He's worried about me!

13:05.367 --> 13:09.580
I'm fine too, although
I'm still not in my best form.

13:09.663 --> 13:14.168
If we lose any more Hashira,
the Corps will be in danger.

13:14.251 --> 13:18.839
Defeating two Upper Ranks
without dying is a tremendous feat.

13:18.923 --> 13:22.551
You two healed unusually fast this time.

13:22.635 --> 13:24.053
INSECT HASHIRA
SHINOBU KOCHO

13:24.136 --> 13:25.930
What happened?

13:26.013 --> 13:29.850
I believe the Master
will talk about that matter too.

13:29.934 --> 13:31.352
WATER HASHIRA
GIYU TOMIOKA

13:36.148 --> 13:38.067
Thank you for waiting so long.

13:39.109 --> 13:41.237
At today's Hashira meeting,

13:41.320 --> 13:46.033
I, Amane Ubuyashiki,
will represent Kagaya Ubuyashiki.

13:47.743 --> 13:52.164
I would also like to apologize sincerely
for the fact that

13:52.248 --> 13:56.210
Master Kagaya will no longer able
to appear before you in the future

13:56.293 --> 13:58.712
due to his declining health.

14:14.812 --> 14:16.355
Understood.

14:16.438 --> 14:19.316
I pray that

14:19.400 --> 14:24.363
his flame of life continues to burn
even one day longer.

14:24.446 --> 14:27.867
I also pray that your spirit
remains strong.

14:30.828 --> 14:34.748
My sincere gratitude to all the Hashiras.

14:37.042 --> 14:39.545
As you may have already heard,

14:39.628 --> 14:43.299
now that a demon who can
withstand the sunlight appears,

14:43.382 --> 14:47.761
Muzan Kibutsuji
will desperately come for her.

14:48.637 --> 14:51.515
So that he can overcome the sun too.

14:52.474 --> 14:54.810
A large-scale war is imminent.

14:56.061 --> 15:02.484
During the fight against Upper Rank
Four and Five, Kanroji and Tokito…

15:04.194 --> 15:09.658
I have received reports that you two
manifested a unique pattern of marks.

15:10.701 --> 15:16.206
I would like you both to tell us about
what conditions caused marks to appear.

15:17.666 --> 15:18.751
Marks?

15:20.377 --> 15:22.463
During the Sengoku period,

15:22.546 --> 15:26.467
there were swordsmen
of the First Breathing

15:26.550 --> 15:29.136
who almost defeated Muzan Kibutsuji.

15:30.471 --> 15:36.518
All of them manifested marks
similar to a demon crest.

15:39.021 --> 15:42.691
Some of you may have heard such tales.
Those in the know, know.

15:43.609 --> 15:47.696
This is the first I've heard of it.
Why were we kept in the dark?

15:48.906 --> 15:54.995
Many people have tormented themselves
over marks that did not manifest.

15:55.079 --> 15:56.205
That's why.

15:57.206 --> 16:01.168
There's a lack of clarity
regarding the legend of the marks.

16:02.503 --> 16:06.298
It could be because it was not
considered important at the time.

16:06.382 --> 16:10.761
Or perhaps, because the Demon Slayer Corps
has nearly been destroyed many times,

16:10.844 --> 16:14.807
the information was not passed down.

16:14.890 --> 16:19.603
Only one thing was left
written down clearly.

16:20.938 --> 16:23.232
"When the marked one appears,

16:23.315 --> 16:28.153
the mark will appear on others around
as well as if in resonance."

16:34.702 --> 16:40.290
That was written down in the journal
of the swordsman of the First Breathing.

16:41.834 --> 16:46.171
The first person in this generation
who did manifest the mark

16:47.172 --> 16:49.883
was not a Hashira.

16:51.010 --> 16:53.178
It was Tanjiro Kamado.

16:53.262 --> 16:56.015
He was the first marked one.

16:57.474 --> 17:03.230
However, he did not seem to know
how the mark manifested,

17:03.313 --> 17:05.733
so we put it aside for the time being.

17:05.816 --> 17:10.696
And this time, following him,
two Hashiras have had this awakening.

17:12.364 --> 17:16.410
Please teach us how to manifest it,
Kanroji and Tokito.

17:19.413 --> 17:20.914
Oh! Sure!

17:20.998 --> 17:23.083
Lady Amane is so admirable.

17:26.295 --> 17:30.049
Well, so, at that time…

17:30.132 --> 17:34.720
If I remember, my body became very light.

17:36.680 --> 17:42.895
And then… It was…

17:46.315 --> 17:48.650
It was like "gwaaah!"

17:48.734 --> 17:52.237
And "whooom!" Then "gaaah!"

17:52.321 --> 17:55.032
My heart was ba-dump ba-dump nonstop!

17:55.115 --> 17:57.493
My ears rang so loud!

17:57.576 --> 17:59.953
Crack-crack-crack, like that!

18:12.257 --> 18:14.051
My deepest apologies.

18:14.134 --> 18:16.970
I'm so ashamed
that I want to crawl into a hole!

18:17.888 --> 18:19.264
SHARE THE SAME BRAIN CELL WITH TANJIRO

18:21.475 --> 18:23.018
Okay, it's my turn.

18:25.562 --> 18:28.482
I wasn't aware any mark manifested on me.

18:29.358 --> 18:32.361
But when I think back to that battle,

18:32.444 --> 18:37.282
there are a few unusual things
that come to mind.

18:38.450 --> 18:43.080
If the conditions are met,
probably everyone could manifest the mark.

18:44.289 --> 18:47.042
Now I'm going to tell you how I did it.

18:59.429 --> 19:04.226
In that battle,
I was poisoned and couldn't move.

19:05.144 --> 19:07.563
When I tried to slow down
my blood circulation

19:07.646 --> 19:11.024
and the spread of the poison
by using the breathing technique,

19:11.108 --> 19:14.820
I saw the boy who wanted to save me
was nearly killed,

19:14.903 --> 19:17.114
my lost memories returned,

19:18.115 --> 19:21.994
and then I couldn't control my emotions
because I was so angry.

19:23.162 --> 19:27.040
I think my heart rate
was over 200 per minute.

19:29.626 --> 19:32.421
Also, my body was burning hot.

19:32.504 --> 19:36.758
My temperature must have reached
over 39 degrees Celsius.

19:38.594 --> 19:42.472
How could you move in such a state?
It could be life-threatening.

19:43.223 --> 19:44.474
You're right.

19:44.558 --> 19:48.228
That's why, it was like being sifted.

19:49.771 --> 19:54.443
I think the difference between those
who manifest the mark and those who don't

19:54.526 --> 19:56.403
is whether you die or not.

20:00.699 --> 20:02.784
A heart rate over 200 per minute…

20:04.119 --> 20:07.414
How can you be sure
your temperature was 39 degrees?

20:08.165 --> 20:14.338
Well, I had a fever when
I was being treated at Kocho's place.

20:15.047 --> 20:19.718
The thermometer showed my body temperature
was 39 degrees.

20:19.801 --> 20:24.306
I felt it was the same heat
when the mark manifested.

20:27.517 --> 20:28.685
I didn't realize.

20:30.395 --> 20:32.648
So, it's really that simple.

20:33.565 --> 20:37.819
I envy you for being a simpleton
to call that simple.

20:38.946 --> 20:40.822
What did you say?

20:40.906 --> 20:42.074
Nothing.

20:46.078 --> 20:49.831
That means we Hashiras
must manifest the mark.

20:50.791 --> 20:52.084
Agreed.

20:52.167 --> 20:54.544
We will do something about it.

20:54.628 --> 20:59.258
Please tell the Master
to rest assured of this.

20:59.341 --> 21:00.801
Thank you.

21:01.885 --> 21:05.180
There is one thing I must tell you

21:05.264 --> 21:08.767
regarding the training
to manifest the mark.

21:08.850 --> 21:10.227
What is it?

21:11.311 --> 21:16.400
Those who have manifested the mark
will have no choice anymore.

21:17.859 --> 21:22.197
Because they, without exception, will…

21:43.969 --> 21:45.095
I understand now.

21:45.679 --> 21:49.558
But in that case, what will happen to me?

21:49.641 --> 21:50.767
Good Lord.

21:51.727 --> 21:55.147
Since Lady Amane has left,
I have nothing more to do here.

21:55.230 --> 21:58.317
Hey, hold on! Don't just leave!

21:58.400 --> 22:02.487
We have to decide
what each of us is going to do.

22:03.363 --> 22:05.782
The six of you can talk among yourselves.

22:05.866 --> 22:07.576
It has nothing to do with me.

22:07.659 --> 22:10.662
What do you mean by that?

22:10.746 --> 22:13.582
You're not aware enough
that you're a Hashira.

22:14.499 --> 22:19.296
Or what? So you can start your training
as soon as possible?

22:19.379 --> 22:21.131
You want to skip the meeting?

22:25.469 --> 22:27.512
Wait, you bastard!

22:27.596 --> 22:30.766
Explain yourself, Tomioka.

22:31.725 --> 22:33.810
You didn't explain enough.

22:37.439 --> 22:39.483
I'm different from you all.

22:40.317 --> 22:41.943
I don't like it.

22:42.694 --> 22:45.822
You said the same thing before, Tomioka.

22:45.906 --> 22:48.492
Are you looking down on us?

22:48.575 --> 22:52.245
Please, don't fight! Stay calm, okay?

22:54.664 --> 22:55.916
Come back here!

22:57.167 --> 23:00.045
No, no! Please, don't!

23:07.511 --> 23:08.678
Sit down.

23:10.305 --> 23:12.224
Let's continue our discussion.

23:12.307 --> 23:14.184
I have a proposal.

23:16.353 --> 23:17.479
Here you go.

23:17.562 --> 23:19.815
Wow! Thank you very much!

23:20.816 --> 23:23.068
You really eat a lot.

23:24.277 --> 23:27.364
Anyway, where are those three girls
and your sister?

23:27.447 --> 23:29.324
I don't see Aoi either.

23:29.407 --> 23:34.538
There's no member in critical condition,
so they've been playing with Nezuko.

23:35.539 --> 23:38.875
Thanks to them,
she's learning to speak little by little.

23:38.959 --> 23:41.086
Oh, I see.

23:41.169 --> 23:42.170
How peaceful.

23:43.421 --> 23:45.257
These dangos are delicious.

23:45.340 --> 23:47.759
Yeah, yeah, I know.

23:47.843 --> 23:52.722
But wouldn't it be a problem
if that Yellow-Head showed up?

23:59.813 --> 24:04.276
Oh, Zenitsu.
Are you done with your mission?

24:04.359 --> 24:06.361
I'm back, Kiyo.

24:06.444 --> 24:10.574
Everyone, Zenitsu is back!

24:14.953 --> 24:17.873
Good work on completing
your mission, Zenitsu.

24:17.956 --> 24:19.749
Good work!

24:19.833 --> 24:24.838
Kiyo, Naho and Sumi.
The three of you came to welcome me?

24:25.630 --> 24:27.549
This time was really tough too.

24:27.632 --> 24:30.635
I thought, "I'm gonna die!"
over and over again.

24:30.719 --> 24:35.557
But everyone would be sad if I died,
so I did my best to survive!

24:35.640 --> 24:38.351
You'd be lonely without me, right?

24:38.435 --> 24:39.769
No, we wouldn't.

24:39.853 --> 24:41.062
What?

24:41.146 --> 24:44.482
But I'm glad you made it back alive.

24:45.734 --> 24:47.110
Thanks.

24:51.489 --> 24:54.826
Oh, Zenitsu. You have returned.

24:54.910 --> 24:56.870
Good work.

24:56.953 --> 24:58.413
Aoi!

24:58.496 --> 25:03.084
Aoi, you must have missed me.
Right? I bet you've been lonely.

25:04.127 --> 25:05.921
Not really.

25:15.764 --> 25:17.599
Welcome back.

25:23.647 --> 25:25.357
So loud!

25:25.440 --> 25:27.192
Welcome back.

25:27.275 --> 25:29.152
She's so cute I could die!

25:29.236 --> 25:30.695
Sure, feel free to die!

25:31.696 --> 25:34.199
What happened, Nezuko? You're talking!

25:34.282 --> 25:37.327
For me? Must be for me, right?
You did great just for me.

25:37.410 --> 25:39.287
I'm very happy!

25:39.371 --> 25:40.872
Please go somewhere else!

25:40.956 --> 25:43.875
Finally, we can get married!

25:43.959 --> 25:45.627
Get away from her!

25:45.710 --> 25:48.129
You looked so lovely under the moonlight,

25:48.213 --> 25:50.465
but you're also irresistible
in the sunlight!

25:50.548 --> 25:51.633
You're wonderful!

25:51.716 --> 25:54.761
If you marry me,
I'll feed you sushi and eel every day!

25:54.844 --> 25:57.389
You can relax. Let's make a family!

25:58.348 --> 26:00.267
Welcome back, Inosuke.

26:04.604 --> 26:06.564
Inosuke?

26:07.399 --> 26:09.567
Inosuke, welcome back.

26:11.778 --> 26:15.407
Where is he? I'm gonna go and kill him.

26:15.490 --> 26:17.784
Don't say violent things!

26:17.867 --> 26:20.662
And where's that Boar-Head?

26:20.745 --> 26:22.414
If you're looking for Inosuke…

26:22.497 --> 26:25.083
Huh? He was there this morning.

26:25.166 --> 26:29.713
Your sister was being taught nonstop
by that Boar-Head, you know?

26:29.796 --> 26:31.172
Being taught what?

26:31.256 --> 26:32.674
Well, about that…

26:32.757 --> 26:35.760
Inosuke! Inosuke! Inosuke! Inosuke!

26:35.844 --> 26:37.887
Imosuke. Imofuke.

26:37.971 --> 26:39.097
Boss Inosuke!

26:39.180 --> 26:40.515
Bush Imosuke.

26:40.598 --> 26:43.184
Inosuke! Inosuke! Inosuke! Inosuke!

26:43.268 --> 26:46.354
He had been trying
to get her to remember his name.

26:46.438 --> 26:49.274
Oh, I didn't know that happened.

26:49.357 --> 26:52.402
By the way, do you have
any more of these dangos?

26:53.111 --> 26:54.654
You still want more?

27:05.248 --> 27:06.750
Haganezuka!

27:08.209 --> 27:09.961
Are your injuries okay now?

27:11.087 --> 27:12.339
I'm glad.

27:17.802 --> 27:19.763
You don't look okay!

27:22.223 --> 27:25.560
Oh, my sword. Thank you.

27:28.229 --> 27:30.482
It's Rengoku's sword guard!

27:31.608 --> 27:35.195
Thank you for protecting Kotetsu.

27:36.696 --> 27:38.865
Please have a seat.

27:38.948 --> 27:40.116
Are you all right?

27:45.747 --> 27:47.916
Bla… Bl… Bla…

27:47.999 --> 27:51.044
Do you mean the blade?
Okay, I'll look at it.

28:01.679 --> 28:02.847
Amazing.

28:02.931 --> 28:05.475
The depth of the black color is different.

28:06.393 --> 28:08.269
The steel is of good quality.

28:08.353 --> 28:12.190
Its previous owner must have been
a very strong swordsman.

28:14.109 --> 28:15.485
The "slay" letter?

28:16.861 --> 28:22.700
The swordsmith who forged it had one goal,
it's a sword to slay all demons.

28:22.784 --> 28:27.664
He didn't engrave his name
or anything else, just a single letter.

28:28.456 --> 28:31.960
The ranking system began
after this sword was made,

28:32.043 --> 28:36.464
and only the Hashiras' swords
were engraved with "Slay the Devils."

28:37.424 --> 28:40.009
Is that so? What an incredible sword.

28:40.093 --> 28:45.014
But wait, I think there wasn't any letter
when I used this last in battle.

28:47.142 --> 28:51.479
That's because I had only sharpened it
up to the first stage.

28:51.563 --> 28:54.816
And you guys took it from me.

28:54.899 --> 28:57.569
I hadn't cleaned the rust off.

28:57.652 --> 28:59.320
Do you want me to kill you?

28:59.404 --> 29:00.447
I'm sorry!

29:00.530 --> 29:04.868
Even now! I'm still crying because
the pain of my wounds hasn't gone!

29:04.951 --> 29:07.036
It hurts so much, it's unbearable!

29:07.120 --> 29:09.748
Thanks to the interruption
while I was sharpening it!

29:09.831 --> 29:12.333
I had to start sharpening all over again!

29:14.002 --> 29:17.338
If we're talking about wounds,
his wounds were more serious.

29:17.422 --> 29:20.133
The bones throughout his body are broken.

29:24.721 --> 29:26.598
I'll kill you!

29:26.681 --> 29:28.099
You didn't hear me?

29:28.183 --> 29:29.809
Listen, Tanjiro!

29:29.893 --> 29:33.480
You will bring me mitarashi dango
until you die!

29:33.563 --> 29:35.690
You understand? Got it?

29:35.774 --> 29:37.776
Yes, I will.

29:38.610 --> 29:41.321
Thank you very much and get well soon.

29:42.489 --> 29:45.658
I've heard rumors about him,
but he's truly something.

29:47.410 --> 29:49.788
Actually, he was calmer than usual.

29:49.871 --> 29:51.581
He must really be in pain.

29:51.664 --> 29:53.041
Seriously?

29:53.124 --> 29:55.168
Can you be quieter, man?

29:55.251 --> 29:57.921
Oh, sorry, Genya.

29:58.004 --> 29:59.631
We're done.

29:59.714 --> 30:01.257
Sorry for being so loud--

30:10.225 --> 30:13.812
Inosuke! What are you doing?
You broke the window!

30:14.938 --> 30:18.399
You fool!
You're gonna get killed by Lady Kocho!

30:20.151 --> 30:21.277
Be quiet!

30:21.361 --> 30:23.071
Boar Rush!

30:24.656 --> 30:27.283
I want a separate room.

30:27.367 --> 30:29.619
Strength! Strength! More strength!

30:29.702 --> 30:32.664
The joint strengthening drill
is about to begin!

30:32.747 --> 30:34.624
Joint strengthening?

30:34.707 --> 30:38.002
The strong guys are gathering
and giving lessons.

30:38.086 --> 30:40.213
Or something like that.

30:40.296 --> 30:42.298
Huh? What's that about?

30:42.382 --> 30:44.092
I don't know!

30:44.175 --> 30:45.677
I see.

30:49.889 --> 30:56.521
I think we've pretty much worked out
our training plan for the Corps members.

30:57.772 --> 31:00.525
All that's left is the date and duration.

31:01.526 --> 31:03.611
Let's start in three days.

31:04.279 --> 31:06.489
Can we do it that soon?

31:06.573 --> 31:08.533
We're racing against time.

31:09.534 --> 31:14.414
Now that we don't know what
Muzan Kibutsuji will do in the future,

31:14.497 --> 31:17.834
I want us to prepare everything we can.

31:17.917 --> 31:21.921
If the demons become more active
after this,

31:22.005 --> 31:25.341
we alone won't be able to handle them.

31:26.134 --> 31:30.305
But wouldn't the demons attack
while we're holding the training?

31:31.639 --> 31:36.895
It's assumed that the demons
will focus on capturing Nezuko Kamado.

31:37.729 --> 31:40.982
In fact, since the incident
in the Swordsmith Village,

31:41.065 --> 31:44.444
the appearance of the demons
has decreased significantly.

31:44.527 --> 31:45.945
If that is the case…

31:46.029 --> 31:52.285
Until now, we could only train our Tsuguko
due to our schedules.

31:52.368 --> 31:54.203
In this short period of time,

31:54.329 --> 31:58.374
we shall use this opportunity
to strengthen the entire Corps.

32:00.043 --> 32:02.253
This is important and urgent.

32:03.379 --> 32:09.802
Yes, it's important,
so I proposed the "Hashira Training."

32:11.304 --> 32:15.391
Himejima, no need to be wordy.

32:16.267 --> 32:17.852
I concur.

32:18.561 --> 32:20.271
No objection.

32:21.689 --> 32:23.191
Me too.

32:23.274 --> 32:24.734
I also agree.

32:26.402 --> 32:29.989
Are there enough active Hashiras
to hold the training?

32:31.199 --> 32:35.244
I'm thinking of asking
the retired Hashiras to help us.

32:35.328 --> 32:37.121
Any objections?

32:37.205 --> 32:38.873
Of course not.

32:39.999 --> 32:41.209
The only thing left is…

32:42.251 --> 32:43.878
Tomioka.

32:50.259 --> 32:54.180
I just got back from a mission,
and now I have to take the training.

32:54.263 --> 32:55.515
I can't stand it.

32:55.598 --> 32:57.767
Are you going now?

32:57.850 --> 33:02.563
Yeah, right. We have to take
the Hashira Training in turns.

33:02.647 --> 33:05.149
Huh? Really? Isn't that great?

33:05.233 --> 33:08.987
It's not great at all. It's horrible.
It's hell.

33:09.070 --> 33:11.531
Whoever proposed this should die already.

33:11.614 --> 33:12.615
Hey!

33:12.699 --> 33:17.829
Sparring with superiors
is a shortcut to improving.

33:17.912 --> 33:23.292
When you face someone stronger,
you absorb it and get stronger yourself.

33:29.590 --> 33:34.178
If you're being so optimistic,
then we're no longer friends from today!

33:34.262 --> 33:35.471
Ouch! Ouch! It hurts!

33:35.555 --> 33:38.349
It's okay for you!
Your bone fracture hasn't healed yet!

33:38.433 --> 33:40.184
You can just go back to sleep!

33:40.268 --> 33:42.270
As for me, I have to go to train now!

33:42.353 --> 33:44.647
Do you know how I feel?

33:45.857 --> 33:47.275
I'm sorry!

33:49.777 --> 33:50.695
Zenitsu.

33:50.778 --> 33:52.572
Don't talk to me!

33:52.655 --> 33:54.282
Wait a minute.

33:54.365 --> 33:57.618
I forgot to say thank you.

34:00.038 --> 34:04.959
When I was fighting Upper Rank Four
and almost couldn't move one of my legs,

34:05.043 --> 34:09.213
thanks to the Thunder Breathing trick
you taught me,

34:09.297 --> 34:11.632
I was able to cut off the demon's head.

34:13.092 --> 34:16.679
Of course,
I couldn't do it as fast as you.

34:16.763 --> 34:18.014
Thank you so much.

34:19.057 --> 34:23.728
Sometimes collaboration with others
can help us get through tight spots.

34:23.811 --> 34:27.440
I'm sure that everything we learn
in the Hashira Training

34:27.523 --> 34:29.609
will lead to a better future.

34:35.239 --> 34:40.119
You fool!
Don't think that's going to fix my mood!

34:40.203 --> 34:42.872
Oh, he looks happy. That's good.

34:42.955 --> 34:45.750
See you later, Tanjiro. Get well soon.

34:45.833 --> 34:49.629
Jeez, everyone's really helpless
without me.

34:54.675 --> 34:57.637
I'm really thankful, Zenitsu.

35:01.849 --> 35:04.352
So slow! So slow! So slow!
You're all slow!

35:08.064 --> 35:12.235
What the hell are you doing?
You guys are really unbelievable!

35:13.903 --> 35:16.739
First of all,
your basic fitness is non-existent!

35:16.823 --> 35:18.741
This is just simple running!

35:18.825 --> 35:22.537
Faster! Move as if the demons
are chasing you!

35:23.871 --> 35:26.374
Hey, hey, I can't hear your voices!

35:26.457 --> 35:28.084
No need to lick the ground!

35:28.167 --> 35:29.961
It isn't break time yet!

35:30.044 --> 35:32.088
Run one more lap!

35:32.171 --> 35:33.548
Please, no more.

35:33.631 --> 35:35.174
You guys are total losers.

35:35.258 --> 35:38.970
The training of the active Hashiras
after this will be even harder.

35:39.887 --> 35:43.808
As I expected, Sir Tengen
is more lively when he's on duty.

35:43.891 --> 35:47.478
Well, of course.
And we must do our best to help him.

35:47.562 --> 35:52.108
Since everyone's hungry,
let's make lots and lots of onigiris!

35:52.191 --> 35:53.276
Yeah.

36:03.035 --> 36:06.414
Sir Tengen, lunch is ready!

36:06.497 --> 36:07.748
Thanks!

36:07.832 --> 36:10.918
Hey! Your meals are ready!

36:11.002 --> 36:12.628
I can't.

36:12.712 --> 36:14.714
I don't feel like eating.

36:16.215 --> 36:18.467
You guys are really sloppy.

36:18.551 --> 36:22.054
Sir Tengen, please don't be
so mad at them.

36:22.138 --> 36:27.018
I'd love to, but if I send them
to the next Hashira like this,

36:27.101 --> 36:28.978
I'll be the one to blame.

36:29.061 --> 36:31.147
-Here, Sir Tengen.
-Thanks.

36:31.230 --> 36:33.316
It's miso soup with lots of salt.

36:36.861 --> 36:40.781
This is nothing compared to
the rest of their training, believe me.

36:41.824 --> 36:45.536
You're in charge
of basic fitness workouts, correct?

36:45.620 --> 36:48.456
What kind of training
do they have after this?

36:48.539 --> 36:50.374
After my training…

36:50.458 --> 36:53.461
First, Tokito's high-speed
movement training.

36:53.544 --> 36:57.465
He'll do harsh things,
even with his poker face.

36:57.548 --> 37:01.344
Next, you'll be greeted by
Kanroji's hellish flexibility training.

37:01.427 --> 37:04.847
Next comes Iguro's training,
improving swordsmanship.

37:04.931 --> 37:07.391
I tell you,
the Serpent Hashira is stubborn.

37:07.475 --> 37:09.268
Next, Shinazugawa's training.

37:09.352 --> 37:11.729
I heard it's endless striking training,

37:11.812 --> 37:14.649
and I'm sure, as the name implies,
there will be no end.

37:14.732 --> 37:18.027
The last one is Himejima's
muscle strengthening.

37:18.110 --> 37:20.863
You have to throw away
your humanity for this one.

37:20.947 --> 37:24.450
The Hashiras are also expected
to improve their strength

37:24.533 --> 37:29.413
as they have to deal
with the Corps members, one after another.

37:30.414 --> 37:32.041
Isn't that flamboyant?

37:33.376 --> 37:37.046
I wish I had the chance to train
with everything I have as well.

37:38.256 --> 37:40.341
I'll leave it to you, everyone.

37:42.385 --> 37:44.095
Come on!

37:46.555 --> 37:50.268
This ain't gonna raise my temperature.

37:50.351 --> 37:51.727
You guys are too weak!

37:53.896 --> 37:56.649
Good, keep it up.

37:56.732 --> 37:58.943
Try it a bit wider!

38:00.987 --> 38:03.948
You never know
where the enemy will attack.

38:06.784 --> 38:07.910
Feel it!

38:09.662 --> 38:13.958
With all these openings, you would have
been eaten by demons three times.

38:14.959 --> 38:17.712
In order to maintain mark condition…

38:18.379 --> 38:20.298
Your side is open.

38:24.302 --> 38:26.178
Do your best, everyone.

38:27.596 --> 38:30.182
We're doing this to slay all the demons.

38:30.349 --> 38:32.893
For the Master's sake.

38:33.978 --> 38:36.689
For the Corps members
who have died so far.

38:37.690 --> 38:40.443
For the people who are still alive.

38:41.402 --> 38:43.738
We have to get through this.

38:44.780 --> 38:46.365
Hang in there.

38:54.623 --> 38:56.250
What's the matter?

39:02.590 --> 39:04.050
I'm bleeding!

39:04.133 --> 39:06.344
What are you suddenly doing? That's mean!

39:08.637 --> 39:10.348
Hurry, hurry.

39:10.473 --> 39:14.143
It's a letter from the Master.
Read it at once.

39:14.226 --> 39:16.687
A letter for me?

39:16.771 --> 39:18.689
I wonder what it is.

39:22.777 --> 39:26.614
Tomioka is not participating
in the Hashira Training?

39:43.589 --> 39:44.673
Master Kagaya,

39:45.466 --> 39:52.139
the Hashiras have begun to train
the Corps members for the upcoming battle.

39:54.433 --> 39:58.854
Your children are carrying out your will

39:58.938 --> 40:01.607
and connecting with your feelings.

40:03.567 --> 40:06.779
They are willing to do it
for the long-held ambition

40:06.862 --> 40:08.781
of defeating Muzan Kibutsuji.

40:15.162 --> 40:16.372
Amane.

40:18.416 --> 40:19.417
Yes?

40:22.086 --> 40:27.883
Thank you so much
for everything you have done.

40:37.393 --> 40:38.519
It's my pleasure.

41:24.482 --> 41:26.525
Good evening, Tamayo.

41:33.532 --> 41:37.620
It is dangerous
to leave a window open at night.

41:42.625 --> 41:45.753
Still, the moon is beautiful tonight.

41:47.046 --> 41:48.756
It's a pleasure to meet you.

41:48.839 --> 41:53.010
I'm Kagaya Ubuyashiki's messenger.

41:55.012 --> 41:59.183
I must admit, you're very good at hiding.

41:59.266 --> 42:04.104
While I was trying to find you,
Ubuyashiki can no longer move.

42:05.439 --> 42:08.817
How did you find this place?

42:10.152 --> 42:12.404
The human network.

42:12.488 --> 42:16.408
I identified the previous owner
of this house you bought.

42:17.576 --> 42:22.790
And during the day,
I grasped how Yushiro's vision works.

42:24.166 --> 42:29.046
Even though I'm trained, I'm just a crow.

42:29.129 --> 42:32.091
No one is wary of me to begin with.

42:33.092 --> 42:38.013
I have no intention of harming you two,
so relax.

42:39.139 --> 42:42.101
Then, what do you want?

42:44.728 --> 42:48.190
You're suspicious of me.
It's understandable.

42:49.108 --> 42:55.573
As expected, it's difficult for me
to gain your trust as Tanjiro did.

42:57.116 --> 42:58.659
What are his intentions?

42:59.702 --> 43:03.289
Is Ubuyashiki trying to deceive me?

43:05.249 --> 43:06.792
Where is Yushiro?

43:06.875 --> 43:09.420
There's no need to worry about Yushiro.

43:11.005 --> 43:14.633
Listen, you can hear
his footsteps running.

43:16.176 --> 43:17.386
Now…

43:18.387 --> 43:20.180
I shall tell you my business.

43:22.725 --> 43:24.351
In the Demon Slayer Corps,

43:24.435 --> 43:29.440
there is also a kid who is knowledgeable
about the demon body and pharmacology.

43:29.523 --> 43:34.403
We would like you to look into Nezuko's
transformation together with her.

43:37.031 --> 43:40.743
In order to defeat Muzan Kibutsuji,
would you work with us?

43:42.870 --> 43:45.414
We invite you to the Ubuyashiki residence.

43:46.749 --> 43:52.087
I, a demon, am invited to the
Demon Slayer Corps headquarters?

43:55.007 --> 43:57.926
EPISODE 1
IN ORDER TO DEFEAT MUZAN KIBUTSUJI

43:58.010 --> 44:01.805
To you who is ignorant of
What eternity means

44:01.889 --> 44:05.059
It's time to show you the answer

44:05.184 --> 44:11.482
Beyond the endless spiral

44:27.373 --> 44:30.793
The reason why it sounded like an excuse

44:30.876 --> 44:34.296
A weakness that draws in a fleeting future

44:34.380 --> 44:39.468
You mistake it for strength

44:40.844 --> 44:44.473
So detestable, so detestable
So disgraceful, so disgraceful

44:44.556 --> 44:47.893
The heart that is so bleak

44:47.976 --> 44:49.770
So dark, so dark

44:49.853 --> 44:51.730
That it almost hides the moon

44:51.814 --> 44:55.317
If only you weren't here

44:55.401 --> 44:58.904
It sways and sways

44:58.987 --> 45:02.533
Carrying on its intentions
Just like a flower

45:02.616 --> 45:05.911
Taking it all away, taking it all away

45:05.994 --> 45:09.415
It tears the heart just like a storm would

45:09.498 --> 45:13.001
To you who is ignorant of
What eternity means

45:13.085 --> 45:16.547
It's time to show you the answer

45:16.630 --> 45:21.927
Beyond the endless spiral

45:22.010 --> 45:26.140
Who awaits there

48:02.671 --> 48:04.631
For every Hashira Training Arc episode,

48:04.715 --> 48:08.719
I'd like to present every Hashira's
Taisho period secret.

48:09.469 --> 48:10.679
Inosuke!

48:11.888 --> 48:14.766
Can you explain what happened
with these broken glasses?

48:14.850 --> 48:16.143
But you know…

48:16.226 --> 48:17.561
Naughty!

48:18.353 --> 48:22.274
Always being positive
is a good part of you,

48:22.357 --> 48:24.901
but there are some things
you shouldn't do.

48:24.985 --> 48:27.112
Let me see your arm.

48:27.195 --> 48:28.947
I'll treat your wound.

48:29.823 --> 48:32.200
Don't ever do that again, understand?

48:36.163 --> 48:41.001
Shinobu is very strict,
but she's a very considerate person.

48:41.835 --> 48:43.754
Even at the last Hashira meeting…

48:43.837 --> 48:46.006
Oh, my, oh, my, oh, my…

48:46.089 --> 48:47.341
Kanroji.

48:48.175 --> 48:49.593
Thank you!

48:49.676 --> 48:51.094
You're welcome.

48:52.179 --> 48:55.015
That's all for this Taisho period secret.

48:55.098 --> 48:56.725
Next up on Episode 2:

48:56.808 --> 48:59.478
"The Sorrows of the Water Hashira,
Giyu Tomioka."

48:59.561 --> 49:00.896
TO BE CONTINUED
